@marcbaechinger Regardless of how good/bad my beginners design was, please be mindful of the fact that ViewPager instantiates multiple fragments simultaneously, even though its only just showing one fragment on the screen/app at any one time.  

So having just one player/notifier manager, while trying to make sure I'm only showing the video/notifications for the one visible fragment, may be problematic to coordinate, especially if you want to show each fragment-specific text as part of the notification. My hope was that the manager would do this for me. 

Again, with my new/limited understanding of Android development design.  Please feel free to comment on any bad design that may be cause of the bug, I won't mind.
